      "mergedPostDetails": "With the current focus on optimisation of user created content, adding UV Tile Culling to Quest Shaders just makes sense, as without it my Quest uploads have to have more skinned meshes and materials than the PC upload does. (or be unable to toggle anything)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "UV Tile Discard for Quest Shaders",
      "parentID": "6433ee886b7c8b09eb6059c9",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
