      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: Its not universally called UV Tile Discard, but that's its function, toggling the rendering of any mesh who's UV's are inside a specific UV tile, Allowing multiple items of clothing to share the same mesh and material (so less drawcalls) and still be able to be toggled on and off.\n\nhttps://gitlab.com/s-ilent/SCSS/-/wikis/Manual/Inventory-System\n\nhttps://www.poiyomi.com/special-fx/uv-tile-discard",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
