      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On cross platform avatars avatar creator should give quest users the ability to take off any type of clothing. Some clothing might be PC only but for certain avatars one creator could not have it to quest. People can remove the clothing and I feel like that should be fixed with this.",
